# Send the Docker daemon only what the Dockerfile COPYs, so nothing else
# (.env, .git, build output, docs, tests, ...) can end up in the build context.
# If the Dockerfile ever COPYs another path, re-include it here.
*
!entrypoint.sh
!autofill_description.py
!pr_description
!requirements.txt

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
